{"text": "And then there's the road nobody can explain. Chah-koh Canyon, New Mexico, in the dry south-west of the United States — roughly a thousand years back, though the dating is argued over. The people there had no wheel, no horse, no ox. Yet they scraped road beds into the desert floor up to nine metres wide, dead straight — one of them runs fifty point five kilometres. Where a cliff stood in the way, they cut stone stairs into the rock face and went straight over. Nothing ever rolled here. So why the width, why the line? The honest answer: nobody knows. Scholars have argued for decades — work, war, worship, politics. A recent laser survey found roads lined up on the midwinter sunrise over a mountain sacred to the Native Pweb-loh peoples today — a hint toward ritual, and still one reading among several. We can map these roads from the air. We can't tell you what they were for.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", "'", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "o", "a", "d", " ", "n", "o", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "c", "a", "n", " ", "e", "x", "p", "l", "a", "i", "n", ".", " ", "C", "h", "a", "h", "-", "k", "o", "h", " ", "C", "a", "n", "y", "o", "n", ",", " ", "N", "e", "w", " ", "M", "e", "x", "i", "c", "o", ",", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "r", "y", " ", "s", "o", "u", "t", "h", "-", "w", "e", "s", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "U", "n", "i", "t", "e", "d", " ", "S", "t", "a", "t", "e", "s", " ", "—", " ", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", "l", "y", " ", "a", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "s", "a", "n", "d", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", ",", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "a", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", "r", "g", "u", "e", "d", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", ".", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "n", "o", " ", "w", "h", "e", "e", "l", ",",